      "description" : "<div class=\"product-detail-dsc-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"product-detail-dsc-food\">Nescafé Blend 43 is proudly roasted and blended from 100% natural coffee beans sourced locally in Gympie, Australia. A signature blend of high quality Arabica coffee beans and full bodied Robusta coffee beans to deliver a consistently bold, well rounded flavour and rich aroma that you can always rely on.\nAustralia's favourite instant coffee. Soluble convenience. Bold and smooth flavour. Made from 100% natural coffee beans. No additives or preservatives. Proudly roasted and blended in Australia.        \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"clearboth\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"coo-logo-frame-bk\">\n        <div class=\"coo-text-bk\">Made in Australia from imported coffee beans</div></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"dms-contents-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"nutrition-container\">\n<div class=\"nutrition-heading-container\">\n<h3 class=\"nutrition-fact\">Nutrition Facts</h3>\n<span class=\"nutrition-serving\">764 cups</span><br />\n<span class=\"nutrition-serving-size-g\">1.7</span></div>\n\n<div class=\"nutrition-table-container\">\n<table class=\"nutrition-table\">\n        <thead>\n                <tr class=\"nutrition-table-header\">\n                        <th class=\"nutrition-first-col\">&nbsp;</th>\n                        <th class=\"nutrition-col nutrition-avg-qty-per-serving\">&nbsp;</th>\n                        <th class=\"nutrition-col nutrition-avg-qty-per-100g\">&nbsp;</th>\n                </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                        <th class=\"nutrition-first-col nutrition-energy\">&nbsp;</th>\n                        <td class=\"nutrition-col-kj\">0</td>\n                        <td class=\"nutrition-col-kj\">0</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                        <th class=\"nutrition-first-col nutrition-protein\">&nbsp;</th>\n                        <td class=\"nutrition-col-g\">0</td>\n          