div>\n\n<div class=\"clearboth\">&nbsp;</div>\n\n<!--<div class=\"dms-contents-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"nutrition-details\">\n<hr class=\"nutrition-hr\" /><i class=\"product-detail-dsc-1 margin-bottom-3\"><strong>Disclaimer</strong><br />\nNo need for refrigeration store at room temperature in a cool dry place away from sunlight and other heat sources (at a temperature between 18°C and 20°C). No colours and preservatives. Consumer Hotline: Australia 1800 627 231 / NZ 0800 441 512 For More Information Visit www.nutella.com.au / www.nutella.co.nz                 </i></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"clearboth\">&nbsp;</div>-->",
